This directory contains all the implemented programs/simulation/tools.

Tools:
   GenerateCSCS: Convert state file to CSCS Paraview visualisation hdf5 file.
   GenerateImposed: Generate an imposed field hdf5 file.
   GenerateSource: Generate a source hdf5 file.
   GenerateState: Generate the initial state file.

Simulations:
   SimulationRun: Generic executable for all simulation implementation. Selection of simulation is done through the IMPLEMENTATION preprocessor macro
